SPARKling MuJoCo — dense Cholesky

The factorization, solve, and rank-one update algorithms in
src/mj-cholesky.adb and their scalar equations are adapted from
MuJoCo 3.14.0, src/engine/engine_util_solve.c. The four-lane reduction
order follows src/engine/engine_util_blas.c.

